           💙ALLAH TA'ALA💙

  🤍Allah Ta'ala ne apne mutaliq Qur'an mein farmaya hai:
✅ *Allah Ta'ala ek hai aur wahi ibadat ke qabil hai, iski zaat mein aur iske kaamon mein koi sharik nahi, na iski koi aulaad hai na wo kisi ki aulaad hai, wo aasmaanon aur zaameenon ka noor hai wo hamesha se hai aur hamesha rahega, usko na neend aati hai na oongh, aasmaanon aur zameenon mein jo kuch hai sab isi ne paida kiya hai baghair iski marzi ke koi iske saamne kisi ki sifarish bhi nahi karsakta hai. Jo kuch hone wala hai jo kuch hochuka hai sab isko maloom hai aasmaanon aur zameen mein koi aisi cheez nahi jo iske ilm mein na ho, wo iska intezaam karne se thakta nahi, aasmaanon aur zameenon mein jo cheez hai wo iski tareef aur paaki bayan karti hai.* 
 ✨Surah Al-Baqarah (2:255) — Ayatul Kursi
 ✨Surah Al-Ikhlas (112:1–4)
✨ Surah An-Nur (24:35)

✅Wahi paida karta hai wahi maut deta hai, wahi maut ke baad qayamat ke din phir zinda karega, Allah sab kuch karsakta hai uski marzi ke baghair koi kuch nahi karsakta, jahan kahin hum hote hain wo hamare saath hota hai wo hamre dilon ki baat bhi jaanta hai wahi sab ko rizq deta hai jis ko chaahe thoda jise chaahe behisab.

✅Iske ekhtiyaar mein hai jise chaahe sultanat de jis ki chaahe sultanat cheen le, jise chaahe izzat de, jise chaahe zillat, deen wa duniya ki sab bhalaiyan iske haath mein hai, wahi aulaad deta hai, jise chaahe bete de aur jise chaahe betiyan, jise chaahe donon aur jise chaahe kuch na de.

✅Wo kisi ko bhalayi dena chaahe to koi isko badal nahi sakta aur jo takleef ka mustahiq hota hai use badalne wala bhi koi nahi.

✅Isi ne aasmaan, suraj, chaand, taare, zameen aur inke darmiyaan jo kuch hai sab ko hamari qidmat par laga diya hai isi ne hamari achchi achchi suratein banadi, isne humko is liye paida kiya ke *iski ibadat aur farma bardari karein* , isne Hazrat Mohammed(ﷺ) ko apna aakhiri Nabi banakar bheja

✅ Hazrat Mohammed(ﷺ) par apna aakhiri kalaam Qur'an Majeed nazil farmaya. Ke mai iski hifazat karoonga.

✅Humko batya hai ke hum khud bhi Qur'an Majeed padhte rahein aur dusre logon ko bhi samjhate rahein.✨
